<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6789060199"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:50.732" ttm:agent="v2"><div begin="21.957" end="52.937" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="21.957" end="25.366" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.957" end="22.833">诚实会让我</span><span begin="22.833" end="23.017">讨</span><span begin="23.017" end="23.474">厌</span> <span begin="23.474" end="24.974">你的话诚实的像是胶</span><span begin="24.974" end="25.366">片</span></p><p begin="25.880" end="29.289" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.880" end="27.091">爱你像不停发烧</span><span begin="27.091" end="28.883">你用行动在为我的炎症消</span><span begin="28.883" end="29.289">炎</span></p><p begin="29.687" end="33.384" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.687" end="30.811">消磨了很多力</span><span begin="30.811" end="31.319">气</span><span begin="31.319" end="32.775">但我的青春已不值一</span><span begin="32.775" end="33.384">提</span></p><p begin="33.651" end="37.276" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.651" end="35.514">我只想在你欠我的账本上</span><span begin="35.514" end="36.671">再狠狠的记上一</span><span begin="36.671" end="37.276">笔</span></p><p begin="37.528" end="41.157" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.528" end="38.631">你是我情话的</span><span begin="38.631" end="38.821">由</span><span begin="38.821" end="39.161">来</span> <span begin="39.392" end="40.576">而我是你情话的</span><span begin="40.576" end="40.740">韭</span><span begin="40.740" end="41.157">菜</span></p><p begin="41.403" end="44.994" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.403" end="42.995">自愿暴露给你的答案</span><span begin="42.995" end="44.462">早已经经不起任何的</span><span begin="44.462" end="44.687">修</span><span begin="44.687" end="44.994">改</span></p><p begin="45.340" end="49.035" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.340" end="45.969">陷入了</span><span begin="45.969" end="46.386">泥</span><span begin="46.386" end="46.744">潭</span> <span begin="46.744" end="46.920">我</span><span begin="46.920" end="47.928">心里面明白也</span><span begin="47.928" end="48.210">斗</span><span begin="48.210" end="48.428">争</span><span begin="48.428" end="49.035">过</span></p><p begin="49.251" end="52.937" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.251" end="49.845">失衡的</span><span begin="49.854" end="50.371">棋</span><span begin="50.371" end="50.662">盘</span> <span begin="50.662" end="50.838">我</span><span begin="50.838" end="51.765">也只能参考你</span><span begin="51.765" end="52.091">修</span><span begin="52.091" end="52.281">正</span><span begin="52.281" end="52.937">我</span></p></div><div begin="53.181" end="1:09.189" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="53.181" end="56.625" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.181" end="53.764">参考你</span><span begin="53.764" end="54.097">修</span><span begin="54.097" end="54.281">正</span><span begin="54.281" end="54.648">我</span> <span begin="54.748" end="56.172">比自己找出口有用的</span><span begin="56.172" end="56.625">多</span></p><p begin="56.652" end="1:00.471" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.652" end="57.650">但是你关上灯</span><span begin="57.650" end="58.142">一盏一</span><span begin="58.142" end="58.533">盏</span> <span begin="58.634" end="59.594">演绎的剧情是</span><span begin="59.594" end="1:00.061">《一半一</span><span begin="1:00.061" end="1:00.471">半》</span></p><p begin="1:00.506" end="1:04.409" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.506" end="1:01.058">一半是</span><span begin="1:01.058" end="1:01.399">憧</span><span begin="1:01.399" end="1:01.607">憬</span><span begin="1:01.607" end="1:02.066">一半是</span><span begin="1:02.066" end="1:02.407">回</span><span begin="1:02.407" end="1:02.574">忆</span> <span begin="1:02.574" end="1:03.491">继续下去也是</span><span begin="1:03.491" end="1:03.841">差</span><span begin="1:03.841" end="1:04.049">不</span><span begin="1:04.049" end="1:04.409">多</span></p><p begin="1:04.458" end="1:09.189" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.458" end="1:05.970">最后也没有圆满的段</span><span begin="1:05.970" end="1:06.274">落</span> <span begin="1:06.429" end="1:07.395">直到连电话也</span><span begin="1:07.395" end="1:07.713">打</span><span begin="1:07.713" end="1:07.905">不</span><span begin="1:07.905" end="1:09.189">通</span></p></div><div begin="1:08.310" end="1:23.658" itunes:songPart="Verse" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="1:08.310" end="1:11.766" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.310" end="1:08.494">每</span><span begin="1:08.494" end="1:08.860">朵</span><span begin="1:08.860" end="1:09.529">黎明的乌</span><span begin="1:09.529" end="1:09.815">云</span> <span begin="1:09.871" end="1:10.305">都像在</span><span begin="1:10.305" end="1:10.487">对</span><span begin="1:10.487" end="1:10.838">我</span><span begin="1:10.838" end="1:11.421">不停的提</span><span begin="1:11.421" end="1:11.766">醒</span></p><p begin="1:11.784" end="1:15.596" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.784" end="1:13.257">他们说如果你再不放</span><span begin="1:13.257" end="1:13.606">手</span> <span begin="1:13.703" end="1:15.228">身边的笑脸都变成泥</span><span begin="1:15.228" end="1:15.596">泞</span></p><p begin="1:15.638" end="1:19.439" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.638" end="1:15.831">我</span><span begin="1:15.831" end="1:16.159">说</span> <span begin="1:16.199" end="1:16.656">心碎的</span><span begin="1:16.656" end="1:16.964">揣</span><span begin="1:16.964" end="1:17.436">测</span> <span begin="1:17.592" end="1:18.642">快乐过廉价的</span><span begin="1:18.642" end="1:19.018">快</span><span begin="1:19.018" end="1:19.439">乐</span></p><p begin="1:19.564" end="1:23.658" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.564" end="1:20.609">假装能凝视你</span><span begin="1:20.609" end="1:20.919">眼</span><span begin="1:20.919" end="1:21.294">睛</span> <span begin="1:21.348" end="1:21.565">你</span><span begin="1:21.565" end="1:22.515">善意的谎言我</span><span begin="1:22.515" end="1:22.864">相</span><span begin="1:22.864" end="1:23.658">信</span></p></div><div begin="1:26.658" end="2:00.134" itunes:songPart="Chorus" ttm:agent="v1"><p begin="1:26.658" end="1:30.463"